{"id":"n1-091","title":"Noun + はどうであれ (~ wa dou de are)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"This phrase means 'regardless of' or 'no matter how…'.","longExplanation":"It is used to convey indifference about the state or condition of a certain thing or matter. You can think of it as 'no matter what' or 'regardless of' in English. The phrase shows the speaker’s strong intention to do something or an assertion that doesn’t change regardless of the noun’s state or condition.","formation":"Noun + はどうであれ","examples":[{"jp":"天候はどうであれ、試合は行われます。","romaji":"Tenkou wa dou de are, shiai wa okonawaremasu.","en":"No matter what the weather is, the match will be held.","words":[{"surface":"天候","vocabId":"1438970","reading":"てんこう"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"あれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"試合","vocabId":"1312420","reading":"しあい"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行わ","vocabId":"1589060","reading":"おこなう","baseForm":"行う"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,4]},{"jp":"結果はどうであれ、最善を尽くすだけです。","romaji":"Kekka wa dou de are, saizen wo tsukusu dake desu.","en":"No matter what the result is, all we can do is try our best.","words":[{"surface":"結果","vocabId":"1254690","reading":"けっか"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"あれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"最善","vocabId":"1294160","reading":"さいぜん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"尽くす","vocabId":"1370090","reading":"つくす"},{"surface":"だけ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,4]},{"jp":"あなたの意見はどうであれ、私は彼を信じます。","romaji":"Anata no iken wa dou de are, watashi wa kare wo shinjimasu.","en":"No matter what your opinion is, I believe him.","words":[{"surface":"あなた","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"意見","vocabId":"1156530","reading":"いけん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"あれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"信じ","vocabId":"1359040","reading":"しんじる","baseForm":"信じる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6]},{"jp":"試験の結果はどうであれ、あなたには何も変わりません。","romaji":"Shiken no kekka wa dou de are, anata ni wa nani mo kawarimasen.","en":"No matter what the result of the test is, nothing will change for you.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"結果","vocabId":"1254690","reading":"けっか"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"あれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あなた","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"何","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"変わり","vocabId":"1510720","reading":"かわり","baseForm":"変わる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6]}],"formalityLevel":"very-formal-literary","usageNote":"Formal, literary \"regardless of/no matter how\".","family":{"id":"regardless-of","name":"Regardless Of (No Matter)","relatedPoints":["n2-169","n1-079","n2-108","n1-210","n1-186"]}}